## The brief

The client's existing WordPress shop took over six seconds to load on mobile. They wanted something fast, but with the same editorial freedom.

## What we did

- Rebuilt the site as a static Astro site.
- Moved product copy into a Git-based CMS.
- Kept checkout on a hosted provider.

## Results

Load time dropped to under a second, and the client now edits products without touching code.
